      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because I want the SOC to read 10%, but the actual battery needs to read 13%, how should I modify it, the zephyr architecture seems to read the actual value of the battery, not the value read by the SOC. See b/237224850#comment9",
      "parentUuid": "d73cef5c_2d990a91",
      "revId": "c2fa263b47644f4fa6e5a0ddca9c57353bceb149",
